  ('IE-CA-SMALL-BS', 'B.II.4', 'B.II', 'Other debtors', '{}'::jsonb, 300, 1, false, '{}'::text[], '{}'::text[], null, 'The VAT on purchases, the VAT repayable by the Collector-General and the Relevant Contracts Tax credit are other debtors. The suspense account reaches this line while it is in debit and item C.9 while it is in credit, which is the one way the format lets two lines share an account.', null),
